flowchart LR
    A[Sending server<br/>hashes headers + body] --> B[Signs hash<br/>with private key]
    B --> C[DKIM-Signature<br/>header attached]
    C --> D[Message in transit]
    D --> E[Receiving server fetches public key<br/>selector._domainkey.domain TXT]
    E --> F{Signature<br/>verifies?}
    F -->|yes| G[DKIM pass]
    D -.body modified in transit.-> H[Body hash mismatch]
    H --> I[DKIM fail]
